挑战：用 {{term:v-for}}="(track, index)" 给每张卡片前加上序号（1. 2. 3. ...），并为每个{{term:元素}}指定稳定的 :key
[[{{term:html}}]]<{{term:details}} {{term:class}}=challenge-answer><{{term:summary}}>💡 查看答案</{{term:summary}}><{{term:div}} {{term:class}}=answer-{{term:content}}><p>修改模板中的 <{{term:code}}>{{term:v-for}}</{{term:code}}>：</p><{{term:pre}}><{{term:code}}>&lt;{{term:template}}&gt;
  &lt;{{term:ul}}&gt;
    &lt;{{term:li}} {{term:v-for}}="(track, index) {{term:in}} filteredTracks" :key="track.{{term:id}}"&gt;
      &lt;{{term:span}} {{term:class}}="num"&gt;{{ index + 1 }}.&lt;/{{term:span}}&gt;
      &lt;{{term:strong}}&gt;{{ track.{{term:name}} }}&lt;/{{term:strong}}&gt;
      &lt;{{term:span}}&gt;— {{ track.composer }}&lt;/{{term:span}}&gt;
      &lt;{{term:span}} {{term:class}}="period"&gt;{{ track.period }}&lt;/{{term:span}}&gt;
    &lt;/{{term:li}}&gt;
  &lt;/{{term:ul}}&gt;
&lt;/{{term:template}}&gt;</{{term:code}}></{{term:pre}}><p>关键：<{{term:code}}>{{term:v-for}}="(track, index)"</{{term:code}}> 中 index 从 0 开始；<{{term:code}}>{{ index + 1 }}</{{term:code}}> 显示为 1,2,3...；<{{term:code}}>:key="track.{{term:id}}"</{{term:code}}> 始终用唯一 ID，不要用 index 做 key。</p></{{term:div}}></{{term:details}}>[[/{{term:html}}]]
